            <ArticleTitle>Pericardial Synovial Sarcoma: A Rare Clinical Entity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>801-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/jocs.12609</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Synovial sarcoma is an extremely rare form of primary malignancy of the pericardium. We present a case of primary synovial sarcoma of the pericardium followed by a review of the literature.</AbstractText>
